==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

